- **Check cannot fail / wrapper status:** line 119. Exact input: run `python scripts/fix_pmid_miscitations_round2.py --dry-run` in a repo with zero files matching `*_REVIEW*.html`. Consequence: it exits `0` after fixing/examining nothing, so a gate can pass vacuously.

